# Without this the build context includes node_modules and .venv, and every
# build uploads hundreds of megabytes.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/coverage
**/ios
**/android
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.superpowers
docs
*.md
